@startuml
title BrewLite A2 - Railway production / CD #53 / 15-11-2026
top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 50
node "Client device" as client {
 artifact "Browser / PWA" as browser
}
rectangle "CI and registry" as ci {
 artifact "GitHub Actions\nverify: install, lint, tests, build\nSource: ce4faf6" as gate
 artifact "GHCR public registry\nAPI + Web image digests\nTag: commit SHA" as registry
 artifact "Deploy job\nworkflow_dispatch / deploy=true\nEnvironment: railway-production\nProject token: Environment secret" as deploy
 artifact "Smoke 8/8\nGET health + Web build SHA\nGET catalog, product and PWA" as smoke
 gate -down-> registry : verify PASS
 registry -down-> deploy : pinned images
 deploy -down-> smoke : rollout SUCCESS
}
node "Railway / BrewLite-Assignment2 / production" as railway {
 node "Railway HTTPS Edge" as edge
 node "BrewLite / Web :3000" as web {
  artifact "Next.js UI + BFF\napps/web/Dockerfile" as next
 }
 node "BrewLite-Assignment2 / API :3001" as api {
  artifact "NestJS + Prisma\nMockPaymentService\napps/api/Dockerfile" as nest
  artifact "Pre-deploy execution (temporary)\nSame pinned API image\nprisma migrate deploy" as migrate
 }
 database "postgres / PostgreSQL 17.12\nbrewlite_a2 :5432\nPrivate network" as pg
 artifact "Volume: postgres-volume-gCFY\n/var/lib/postgresql/data" as volume
 edge -down-> next : HTTP 3000
 next -down-> nest : Private HTTP 3001
 nest -down-> pg : Private PostgreSQL 5432
 migrate -down-> pg : Migration
 pg -down- volume : Persistent storage
 note right of web
 Runtime configuration in Railway variables.
 CHECKOUT_V2_ENABLED=1; origins/cookie/upstream.
 Secrets excluded from Git and NEXT_PUBLIC_*.
 Web /api/health proxies API /health.
 Application logs available in Railway.
 end note
}
browser --> edge : HTTPS 443
deploy ..> railway : API first, then Web
smoke ..> edge : Public HTTPS
node "Local development (separate from production/A1)" as local {
 artifact "Compose: Web/BFF :3000, API :3001, PostgreSQL :5432\nBrowser: localhost:3100 / separate DB, volume and env" as compose
}
legend bottom
Only Web has public domain: brewlite-production.up.railway.app.
API and DB use private network; hostnames/digests are listed in DEPLOYMENT.md and CD evidence.
BFF belongs to Next.js; Prisma and mock payment belong to NestJS.
Migration is temporary execution, not a fourth permanent service.
CI script does not change scaling; high availability is not claimed.
DB restart / live rollback / PWA HTTPS install and full AC sign-off remain unverified.
Old Postgres 18 is outside target topology; not deleted.
endlegend
@enduml
